0 Toggle Press — one-motor over-centre guided ram
0 Name: toggle-press.ldr
0 Author: CrispStrobe
0 !LDRAW_ORG Unofficial_Model
0 !LICENSE BSD-3-Clause : see ../licenses/toggle-press.txt
0 // Original toggle linkage and pivot tower by CrispStrobe; support frame adapted from BSD-3 Quickstroke.
0 // One motor on hub port A. Saved encoder datum A=0 degrees.
0 // Geometry LDU: crank 60, coupler 160, upper/lower toggle 120; fixed U=(40,120).
0 // Saved points X/Z: C=(0,-60), K=(126.986818,37.336263), R=(213.973636,120).
0 // Program target A=-80 deg -> geometric crank -10 deg; return A=0.
0 // Measure ram at slider_cross local point (0,0,0) relative to support_rail_60 local point (0,0,0).
0 // Two 16L guide axles provide anti-roll support; guide holders and end bushes retain both rails.
0 // External standard LDraw meshes are referenced, not embedded. Connect motor cable to hub A.
